  {
    "id": "c297",
    "name": "1. Flood coverage",
    "text": "1, We will pay for direct physical loss or damage to covered property caused by flood within a state(s) or at a location(s) shown on the Schedule of this endorsement. In addition, if coverage is provided for business income or extra expense in B. Coverages of the DECLARATIONS, Form RM1000, we will pay for covered loss of business income or extra expense that results from direct physical loss or damage to covered property caused by flood within a state(s) or at a location(s) shown on the Schedule of this endorsement."
